# A paced walkthrough for a PR proof: typing is slowed so the recording is
# watchable, and each beat holds long enough to read. Played by `just tui-see run <this>
# --video`: the snaps are the stills, run.gif the motion.
#! solo --size 80x24
type-ms 45
wait 400
type hello from yi
snap typed
wait 600
key enter
wait-idle 20000
snap answered
wait 900
quit
